#: ../../../reference/interfaces/kernel-firmware-control-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/kernel-firmware-control-interface.md:8
msgid "kernel-firmware-control interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/kernel-firmware-control-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"The ` kernel-firmware-control` interface permits the setting of a custom  "
"[kernel firmware search path](https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/v4.18/driver-"
"api/firmware/fw_search_path.html), and is typically used with {ref}`the "
"remoteproc interface <interfaces-remoteproc-interface>` to upload "
"microcontroller firmware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/kernel-firmware-control-interface.md:13
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/kernel-firmware-control-interface.md:15
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/kernel-firmware-control-interface.md:15
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/kernel-firmware-control-interface.md:19
msgid ""
"This interface controls a resource shared by the whole system. Snaps that "
"use it can be installed as parallel instances, but every instance acts on "
"the same system resource and snapd does not coordinate between them. Make "
"sure each instance manages different resources, or run only one instance at "
"a time. See {ref}`Snaps that are unsupported as parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-shared-resources>` for details.."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/kernel-firmware-control-interface.md:22
msgid "Requires snapd version _2.62+_."
msgstr ""

